    <value>Fresh Halal-Meat</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Top quality for your enjoyment:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fresh lamb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fresh veal and beef&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fresh chicken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Poultry and lamb liver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% Halal, fresh daily and prepared according to the highest hygiene standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardButton1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>To butcher shop</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardTitle2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Reliable and regular delivery service</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We come to you! Take advantage of our regular delivery service. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Punctual delivery on fixed days every week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We deliver our products—including fresh meat and all your daily essentials—directly to your doorstep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, convenient, and always fresh—your groceries from Syriana, delivered right to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find out the exact delivery times for your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardButton2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>View Delivery Schedule</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardTitle3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Our Product Range</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>From local specialties to European market favorites – we have it all.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 500 carefully selected items for your daily needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top quality and attractive offers, all in one place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover our product range now and enjoy a unique shopping experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
