    <value>Enjoy Arabic drinks.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pure Refreshment for Every Taste!
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience pure refreshment with our Arabic beverages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A wide selection of soft drinks and natural juices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy our chilled drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardButton4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>To select</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardTitle5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fresh Frozen Foods for Quick Meals</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Enjoy premium frozen products with a fresh taste and minimal effort.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garden-fresh vegetables that retain their vitamins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traditional specialties such as Kibbeh, Sambusa, and Falafel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find everything you need for a delicious meal in record time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardTitle6" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Arabian Roasted Goods &amp; Snacks</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText6" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The perfect snack treat for your cozy evenings!
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freshly roasted seeds and nuts (sunflower seeds, pumpkin seeds, Chinese mix, nuts, and much more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A wide variety of corn snacks in various flavors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the finest selection of traditional Oriental snacks—available directly from us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
  </data>
