    <value>Exquisite Arabic Sweets</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionCardText7" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Whether as an elegant gift or for your own coffee table—our sweets are always a delight. Discover the world of fine Oriental confectionery.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maamoul, Barazek, Ghraybeh, and much more await you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traditional recipes featuring high-quality ingredients for the ultimate indulgence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whether as an elegant gift or for your own coffee table—our sweets are always a highlight.&lt;/li&gt;
